tive proinsulin folding in pancreatic cells, hence may play a role in glucose homeostasis."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}